# CR 608.2b, 702.16k: a target is checked again as the spell resolves. On turn 4 Bot2's Oblivion Ring exiles Bot1's Absolute
# Virtue, so Bot1 has no protection and Bot2's Lightning Bolt can target Bot1. In response Bot1's Abrupt Decay destroys the
# Ring; its leaves-the-battlefield trigger returns Absolute Virtue (CR 610.3), and Bot1 has protection from Bot2 again. The
# Bolt's only target is now illegal, so it doesn't resolve: Bot1 stays at 20. Absolute Virtue is a new object (CR 400.7),
# untouched.

